• What is the appropriate activation temperature for the smart material fasteners, and is it safely above the product's maximum operating temperature?
• Can the smart material elements be sourced at a cost that makes economic sense for the product volume?
• Is the active disassembly process compatible with existing remanufacturing facility infrastructure?
• Can the smart material fasteners be replaced and reset during reassembly for subsequent lifecycle loops?
• What is the environmental profile of the smart materials used — are they themselves recyclable or recoverable?